! CORGPLATES on the device, TMAX=0 (the s range on the device), Savitzky-Golay SMOOTHING, two in a row. Only
! an output file, so the particles must be elegant's.
C: CHARGE, TOTAL=1e-9
D: DRIF, L=0.5
CPL: CORGPLATES, L=1.0, HALFGAP=2e-3, PERIOD=0.5e-3, DEPTH=0.5e-3, TMAX=0, SMOOTHING=1, SG_HALFWIDTH=3, SG_ORDER=1
BL: LINE=(C, D, CPL, CPL, D)
